LICH-004 Seed Corpus: MBC Parser

MBC instruction format: [Opcode:1][Operand1:4][Operand2:4] = 9 bytes
Programs must be 9-byte aligned.

Opcodes:
  0x00 NOP    0x01 LOAD   0x02 STORE  0x03 ADD
  0x04 SUB    0x05 MUL    0x06 DIV    0x07 MOD
  0x08 AND    0x09 OR     0x0A XOR    0x0B SHL
  0x0C SHR    0x10 JMP    0x11 JEQ    0x12 JNE
  0x13 JGT    0x14 JLT    0x20 CALL   0x21 RET
  0x30 EMIT   0xFF HALT
